"value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4714760","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1847286114040802","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"update","title":"Apotheosis Engine QOL Demo Update (2.2)","summary":"As I've been working on the main game through Nextfest I have implemented in the demo which have been implemented into the main game.Better support for 4K screensBetter options menu:UI and text scalingSystem mouse cursor optionsFixed some player raised bugsBetter pause (you can pause the game if you didn't already know with the space bar)Other inconsequential fixes that barely anybody will see like scientific notation for resources, windows retaining size and position on game close and some reso","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T22:16:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040802","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:36:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1846651706690863","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"APOTHEOSIS ENGINE Releases on NOVEMBER 11TH","summary":"Apotheosis Engine is releasing on November 11th 2026 London (UK): 7:00 PMBerlin / Paris (Central Europe): 8:00 PMNew York (US Eastern): 2:00 PMChicago (US Central): 1:00 PMLos Angeles (US Pacific): 11:00 AMBrasília (Brazil): 3:00 PMTokyo (Japan): 3:00 AM (next day)Beijing (China): 2:00 AM (next day)Sydney (Australia): 5:00 AM (next day)Auckland (New Zealand): 7:00 AM (next day)Thanks for your support and wishlists throughout development. The game was initially meant to release on November 4th, b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:45:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1846651706687379","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"Apotheosis Engine NEW DEMO & NEXTFEST","summary":"Hi everyone! It's been a busy few weeks here, and we've got some fun news to share. Apotheosis Engine is going through the final checks from Steam. It also also taking part in Steam NEXTFEST. Wishlists are looking healthy and the game is just going through some final polish, finishing touches, and just some extra hidden content that would have otherwise been a post-launch patch so I'm glad top be able toget all these extra goodies in for launch!There is a NEW DEMO. It is a much better representa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:29:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687379","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1842846814439623","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"State of Development: APOTHEOSIS ENGINE","summary":"Hello, and thank you for following the project.It's been a while since the last update, and a quiet store page can look like an abandoned one. So the first thing to say, plainly: development is continuing, it has never stopped, and we now have a date.APOTHEOSIS//PROBE releases on Steam on November 6th, 2026.Here's a short gameplay video which I've been plopping on Youtube Shorts to show some up to date development:If you are new here: APOTHEOSIS//PROBE is an idle game played as a retro operating","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T08:37:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439623","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1839041357023779","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"Apotheosis Engine - New Demo is OUT NOW","summary":"The new demo for 'Apotheosis Engine' is now out for playtesting and feedback. The demo is time limited to 30 minutes, but you can see how far you can get!Of course things may be tweaked before final release. Check out the big green button on the store page to get the new demo:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T12:15:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357023779","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1839041357023482","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"Apotheosis Engine - Major Rework","summary":"The original game concept I uploaded for 'Apotheosis engine looked like this, an idle game where you, a probe, flew left to right, collected matter and upgraded yourself.It was fun, but it wasn't fun or polished enough to really release commercially, and as the game grew, it had more and more issues and because laggy and not fun to play. I struggled to design it in a way that the growth felt meaningful.Over the past few months I have been reworking Apotheosis Engine, as can be seen from the foll","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T09:29:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357023482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1832700592792013","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"Apotheosis Engine Demo Released!","summary":"The demo version of 'Apotheosis Engine' has been released. It is now available to download via Steam. The demo includes a recent version of 'Stage 1- Probe', although the experience is subject to change for the final release. Check it out and leave some feedback!The first stage is a pure incremental game; the probe flies, you click and optimise and build. Future stages have much more varied gameplay!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T13:34:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592792013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665590-1830797770243843","game_id":"steam-4665590","kind":"announcement","title":"Apotheosis Engine Announced","summary":"We are happy to announce 'Apotheosis Engine'; an addictive Idle clicker game. Set in the infinite reaches of an alternate dimension; you play as a simple probe from a long distant civilization; one among millions. Drifting for millennia, the probe evolves, grows and shapes itself. Survival for the probe no longer becomes merely an option; it must grow, become sentient, and then follow the rules of survival; explore expand exploit exterminate. The only way to exterminate is to become a god.wheeee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-27T23:41:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770243843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4665590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4665590":"2026-10-26T13:17:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4665590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:49Z"},"4714760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:50Z"